            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nLocal Seafood by the Sea\nDec 2020\nIf you're looking for a seaside option for seafood, this is a very good one. It's a bit off of the main strip but it's still by the beach. We were the only foreigners here and we got the sense that not too many wander in. But, that shouldn't deter anyone from trying. No one speaks English but between pictures and pointing, you'll do fine. The prices were pretty reasonable - standard for seafood which means more expensive than standard Vietnamese fare but far lower than western prices. \n\nThe service was fast and friendly and the food was really tasty - especially the large clams! And, the bathrooms were particularly clean for a restaurant of this style.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 29, 2020",
